From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Soultaco83 <soulnacho@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Fix login page DOMPurify ReferenceError

The session-login chunk aborts while it is being evaluated:

    Uncaught (in promise) ReferenceError: DOMPurify is not defined
        at 78856 (session-login.<hash>.chunk.js:2:3707)

src/apps/legacy/controllers/session/login/index.js imported the dompurify
default export as `createDOMPurify` (dompurify 2.5.9 exposes the callable
factory instance as its default export; there is no `createDOMPurify`
named export). A previous revision of this patch renamed only the call
site to `DOMPurify()`, leaving no binding with that name inside the
module. Webpack does not resolve bare identifiers, so it emitted a
reference to an undeclared global and the whole legacy login controller
failed to evaluate: the router never rendered the login view and the
browser stayed on the `#/login?serverid=...&url=%2Fhome` redirect.

Neither tsc (`checkJs: false` in tsconfig.json, so .js files are not
type-checked) nor webpack (a free variable is not a compile error) reject
this, which is why the broken bundle shipped.

Rename the import to `DOMPurify` so the binding used by the call site
exists, and keep constructing a dedicated DOMPurify instance so the
relaxed ALLOWED_URI_REGEXP (matrix/tg/whatsapp/signal/irc links inside the
login disclaimer) is not applied to the shared default instance that the
other sanitize call sites rely on.

Verified with webpack 5 + dompurify 2.5.9 (target: web, the
build:production toolchain): the module evaluates, the dedicated instance
keeps `matrix:` links and the shared instance still strips them. The
import name now also matches the other DOMPurify call sites in the
codebase (dialog, listview, itemDetails, htmlVideoPlayer, MarkdownBox.tsx,
ConnectionErrorPage.tsx).

diff --git a/src/apps/legacy/controllers/session/login/index.js b/src/apps/legacy/controllers/session/login/index.js
index dad0b7d..a9ff7ad 100644
--- a/src/apps/legacy/controllers/session/login/index.js
+++ b/src/apps/legacy/controllers/session/login/index.js
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-import createDOMPurify from 'dompurify';
+import DOMPurify from 'dompurify';
 import markdownIt from 'markdown-it';
 
 import { AppFeature } from 'constants/appFeature';
@@ -22,7 +22,7 @@ import { getDefaultBackgroundClass } from 'components/cardbuilder/utils/builder'
 
 import './login.scss';
 
-const domPurify = createDOMPurify();
+const domPurify = DOMPurify();
 domPurify.setConfig({
     // eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/naming-convention, sonarjs/regex-complexity -- DOMPurify config option; customizes its default regex
     ALLOWED_URI_REGEXP: /^(?:(?:https?|mailto|tel|callto|cid|xmpp|matrix|tg|whatsapp|signal|ircs?):|[^a-z]|[a-z+.-]+(?:[^-a-z+.:]|$))/i

